\title{metaDyn: Multivariate Meta-Analysis of Dynamic Model Estimates}
\author{Ivan Jacob Agaloos Pesigan}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\section*{Description}

Fits fixed-, random-, or mixed-effects multivariate meta-analysis models using dynamic model estimates from each individual.

\section*{Installation}

You can install the CRAN release of \texttt{metaDyn} with:

%% begin.rcode
% #| eval = FALSE
% install.packages("metaDyn")
%% end.rcode

You can install the development version of
\texttt{metaDyn}
from
\href{https://github.com/jeksterslab/metaDyn}{GitHub}
with:

%% begin.rcode
% #| eval = FALSE
% if (!require("pak")) install.packages("pak")
% pak::pkg_install("jeksterslab/metaDyn")
%% end.rcode

\section*{More Information}

See
\href{https://jeksterslab.github.io/metaDyn/index.html}{GitHub Pages}
for package documentation.

